codex
I found the concrete environment cause: the sandbox exposes a `/proc` PID namespace inconsistent with `getpid()`, while Lean 4 resolves its executable through `/proc/<pid>/exe`; Lake itself starts, but the Lean subprocess cannot locate itself. I’m applying a narrowly scoped read-only runtime shim in `/tmp/audit-work` that only redirects numeric `/proc/*/exe` lookups for the Lean process to the pinned executable, then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted checker.
apply patch
