+
+## Stage 4 preflight, obligation bijection, and target identity
+
+I reran `tools.klean_preflight.check_generation` with `PYTHONPATH=/reference`
+and exactly these immutable inputs:
+
+- `/reference/k-proof`;
+- `/reference/lemma-discovery.json`;
